  "outstanding": [
    "MHC-01 through MHC-03 derive the common maximal genus, including the dyadic integral isometry. The unitary local density formula is cited. The explicit bad-place factor, weighted fibres and index count are derived here. The Gaussian calculation illustrates only the pair and index identities."
